{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54536","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营上，云若死灰扬。\n若似（辛本、川本作「盖」）卧鱼或乍见，此爲衰气不须张，不动将兵（辛本、川本作「军」）亡。\n（移寨远处吉。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}